        "subject": "Flavor Text"
      },
      "translations": {
        "de_DE": {
          "text": "Diese kleinen Kreaturen leben in den Ruinen und können Harz aus einer Meile Entfernung erschnüffeln.",
          "locale": "de_DE"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "text": "Estas criaturitas, habitantes de las ruinas, huelen la savia a kilómetros de distancia.",
          "locale": "es_ES"
        },
        "it_IT": {
          "text": "Originarie delle rovine, queste piccole creature riescono a fiutare la linfa da oltre un chilometro di distanza.",
          "locale": "it_IT"
        },
        "en_US": {
          "text": "Indigenous to the ruins, these little creatures can smell Sap from a mile away.",
          "locale": "en_US"
        },
        "fr_FR": {
          "text": "Ces petites créatures indigènes peuvent flairer la Sève à des kilomètres à la ronde.",
          "locale": "fr_FR"
        }
      },
      "id": "01JBT1A43DSG4RFCF0HV6EF70M",
      "text": "Indigenous to the ruins, these little creatures can smell Sap from a mile away."
    }
